source_facts:
["These features are created for each class, indicating whether the sample satisfies the rules associated with that class (i.e., either '0' or '1').", 'The probability for each class \mathbf{p}^i is computed as follows:

\begin{align}
\text{logit}_k^i &= \max(\mathbf{w}_k, 0) \cdot \mathbf{z}_k^i, \nonumber \\
\mathbf{p}^i &= \text{Softmax}({[\text{logit}_{1}^i, ..., \text{logit}_{c}^i]}). \label{eq:infer_prob}
\end{align}']

text_sentences:
["These features are created for each class, indicating whether the sample satisfies the rules associated with that class (i.e., either '0' or '1').", 'The probability for each class \mathbf{p}^i is computed as follows:

